{
  "title": "S3 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "이미지·문서·로그 등의 데이터를 객체로 저장하는 서비스입니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#guide-1\">데이터를 저장하고 접근하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#guide-2\">보존과 비용 관리</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>45 / 62</span></div><h1>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>S3는 <strong>데이터를 객체<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 단위로 저장하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 사진, 문서, 백업, 로그, 분석용 데이터처럼 많은 파일을 보관하고 API로 읽고 쓸 때 사용합니다.</p><p>데이터를 담을 버킷을 만들고 객체에 이름을 붙여 저장합니다. 저장 공간을 늘리기 위해 디스크를 직접 추가할 필요 없이 데이터 규모에 맞춰 사용할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"buckets-objects-and-keys\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"general-purpose-buckets\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"directory-buckets-and-s3-express-one-zone\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"table-buckets-and-vector-buckets\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"strong-consistency\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"versioning-and-delete-markers\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"lifecycle-rules\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"replication\"></span><h2>데이터를 저장하고 접근하기</h2><p>객체는 <strong>버킷과 키</strong>로 식별합니다. <code>photos/2026/image.jpg</code>처럼 경로 모양의 키를 사용할 수 있지만, 일반 버킷에서 객체를 실제 디렉터리의 파일처럼 연결해 사용하는 방식은 아닙니다.</p><p>접근 권한은 IAM과 버킷 정책 등으로 관리합니다. 기본적으로 비공개로 두고, 특정 파일을 잠시 공유할 때는 미리 서명된 URL을 사용할 수 있습니다.</p><p>객체를 성공적으로 저장하거나 덮어쓴 뒤에는 최신 결과를 읽거나 목록으로 확인할 수 있습니다. 애플리케이션이 같은 객체를 동시에 변경할 경우의 충돌 처리는 별도로 설계합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"object-ownership-and-block-public-access\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"bucket-policies-access-points-and-iam\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"encryption\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"presigned-urls\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"multipart-upload-and-transfer-acceleration\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"object-lock\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"event-notifications-and-batch-operations\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"static-website-hosting-and-cloudfront\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"inventory-storage-lens-and-access-logs\"></span><h2>보존과 비용 관리</h2><p><strong>버전 관리</strong>는 덮어쓰기나 삭제에 대비해 이전 버전을 보관합니다. 수명 주기 규칙으로 오래된 객체를 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">스토리지 클래스</a>로 옮기거나 만료시킬 수 있습니다.</p><p>다른 리전이나 계정으로의 복제, 보존 기간 동안 삭제를 제한하는 Object Lock, 업로드 후 작업을 시작하는 이벤트 알림을 요구에 맞춰 사용합니다. 암호화와 접근 권한은 각각 설정합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>S3에 데이터를 보관하는 과정</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>버킷 준비</strong><span>리전·권한·보존 설정</span></li><li><strong>객체 저장</strong><span>키와 데이터 업로드</span></li><li><strong>필요할 때 접근</strong><span>API·서명된 URL 등</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">웹 콘텐츠 전달에는 CloudFront를 연결하고, 저장과 접근 권한은 S3에서 관리할 수 있습니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>사용자 사진의 원본과 변환 결과를 비공개 버킷에 저장합니다. 조회할 때는 권한을 확인한 뒤 짧은 유효기간의 서명된 URL을 발급합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>객체</strong> — 데이터 본문, 이름인 키, 데이터의 속성을 나타내는 메타데이터를 함께 저장하는 단위입니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/Welcome.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon S3? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/directory-buckets-overview.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Working with directory buckets ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q017\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q036\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q036\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q036</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q036/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs an image transformation that takes a few seconds whenever a file is uploaded. Which option avoids managing servers directly?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q036\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Multi-AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q036\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Lambda</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q036\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An always-on dedicated EC2 instance only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q036\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>는 이벤트 기반의 짧은 코드 실행에 알맞다. 실행 한도와 동시성을 점검한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q040\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q040\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q040</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q040/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web application stores image files by key and serves them over HTTP. Which service should it consider first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>는 객체 저장과 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 접근에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q041\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q041\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q041</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q041/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to recover older object versions after an S3 object is overwritten or deleted. Which feature should it enable?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q041\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q041\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q041\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS Multi-Attach</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q041\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 버전 관리는 이전 버전을 보존한다. 비용과 삭제 마커도 고려한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q042\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q042\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q042</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q042/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Compliance records will rarely be accessed for years, and long retrieval times are acceptable. Which storage class is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q042\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q042\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Standard</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q042\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EFS Standard</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q042\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-deep-archive\">Deep Archive</a>는 장기 보관과 느린 복원 허용에 맞는다. 최소 보관 기간과 검색 요금도 검토한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">S3 Storage Classes</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">이전 용어 <b>RPO / RTO</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">다음 용어 <b>S3 Storage Classes</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
